---
title: Cinnamon French Toast
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Good Morning, Morning Glory!
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@large egg{1}
@skim milk{0.25%cup}
@cinnamon{0.5%tsp}
@French or Italian bread{8%1-inch diagonally cut slices}
@egg whites{2}
@vanilla{0.5%tsp}
@nutmeg{1/8%tsp}

In a bowl, using a whisk, beat the egg and egg whites until foamy. Add the milk, vanilla, cinnamon and nutmeg. Beat well and set aside. Dip the slices of bread into the egg mixture draining off excess mixture. Cook on griddle until golden brown.
